  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4014301",
      "subQuestName": "查看望舒客栈外的告示",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401430101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401430101": {
            "id": "401430101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「招聘启事…望舒客栈现高薪急聘临时厨师一位，待遇从优，酬劳面议…」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430102"
            ]
          },
          "401430102": {
            "id": "401430102",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#——{NICKNAME}！你看你看，高薪急聘！有赚钱的机会！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430103"
            ]
          },
          "401430103": {
            "id": "401430103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "望舒客栈怎么会突然招厨师？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430104"
            ]
          },
          "401430104": {
            "id": "401430104",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "欸…你说的对哦，不会是言笑出什么事了吧？那家伙连别人随便进厨房都要训一顿…不像是会招人来帮工的啊？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430105"
            ]
          },
          "401430105": {
            "id": "401430105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "告示后面好像还有…「有意者请移步楼上与掌柜淮安详谈…」要不我们也上去看看？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430107",
              "401430109"
            ]
          },
          "401430107": {
            "id": "401430107",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嗯——顺便也去问问酬劳有多少！"
          },
          "401430109": {
            "id": "401430109",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…顺、顺便也能关心一下言笑嘛！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014302",
      "subQuestName": "向望舒客栈掌柜淮安询问详情",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401430201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401430201": {
            "id": "401430201",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "…掌柜的，真没必要。不过是烫着手而已，也不耽误我做菜呀。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430202"
            ]
          },
          "401430202": {
            "id": "401430202",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "就算现在不耽误做菜，也耽误你痊愈啊。这几天你先歇着，我们来想办法…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430203"
            ]
          },
          "401430203": {
            "id": "401430203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿，掌柜的！还有言笑！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430204"
            ]
          },
          "401430204": {
            "id": "401430204",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "#嗯？是{NICKNAME}和派蒙啊！什么风把你俩给吹来了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430205"
            ]
          },
          "401430205": {
            "id": "401430205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我们在楼下看到了招聘启事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430206"
            ]
          },
          "401430206": {
            "id": "401430206",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "然后就想上来…上来问问言笑怎么了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430207"
            ]
          },
          "401430207": {
            "id": "401430207",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "唉！我就说不该贴那张告示，居然连你们也开始担心了…多大点事啊…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430208"
            ]
          },
          "401430208": {
            "id": "401430208",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "哈哈，两位能有这份心，我先替言笑谢过了。欸，你也别不好意思了，就跟他们说说呗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430209"
            ]
          },
          "401430209": {
            "id": "401430209",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "行吧…其实就是前阵子过海灯节，来的客人太多。起锅的时候有点心急，不小心烫着了手…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430210"
            ]
          },
          "401430210": {
            "id": "401430210",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "没想到言笑也会犯这种错…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430211"
            ]
          },
          "401430211": {
            "id": "401430211",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "咳！常在河边走，哪能不湿鞋嘛。再好的厨子也总有失手的时候！况且这点小伤，根本不碍事…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430212"
            ]
          },
          "401430212": {
            "id": "401430212",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "你可别逞强了，到时候伤势要是更重，就不是休养一天两天的事了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430213"
            ]
          },
          "401430213": {
            "id": "401430213",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "可这海灯节过去没多久，店里的客人那么多，还不是休息的时候吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430214"
            ]
          },
          "401430214": {
            "id": "401430214",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "客人里头还有不少远道而来的外宾，这要是随便找个厨子应付，万一砸了我们客栈的招牌…我第一个不答应！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430215"
            ]
          },
          "401430215": {
            "id": "401430215",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "瞧你这话说的，都不知道谁是掌柜了…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430216"
            ]
          },
          "401430216": {
            "id": "401430216",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "不过他说的也在理，言笑怎么说也是当初「厨王争霸赛」的种子选手，随便找个厨师，还真不好代班。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430217"
            ]
          },
          "401430217": {
            "id": "401430217",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "也不是我自夸，这种水平的厨师，应该都有自己的生意要照顾吧？能抽出空来客栈帮忙的，怕是不好找。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430218"
            ]
          },
          "401430218": {
            "id": "401430218",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "唉，看来还得再提高一点报酬…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430219"
            ]
          },
          "401430219": {
            "id": "401430219",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "唔…厨艺很好、又有时间的人…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430222"
            ]
          },
          "401430222": {
            "id": "401430222",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊——不就是你吗！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430223"
            ]
          },
          "401430223": {
            "id": "401430223",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "对呀，仔细一想，之前是有听说过…当时只记着你身手了得，都忘了你还有这手厨艺了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430224"
            ]
          },
          "401430224": {
            "id": "401430224",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "不记得厨艺只记得身手…这是客栈掌柜该记的吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430225"
            ]
          },
          "401430225": {
            "id": "401430225",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "哈，不用在意细节。总之，你要是愿意来的话，言笑应该也能放心把厨房交给你吧？你说是吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430226"
            ]
          },
          "401430226": {
            "id": "401430226",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "#这…如果是{NICKNAME}的话…唉，确实，总比交给其他人要好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430227"
            ]
          },
          "401430227": {
            "id": "401430227",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#那，{NICKNAME}，我们要接下这份工作吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014308",
      "subQuestName": "【隐藏】用来切场景用$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014303",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑对话开始工作",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401430301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401430301": {
            "id": "401430301",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "事不宜迟，直接来试试吧。基本的烹饪应该不用我多嘴。要注意的无非就是每桌不同的需求，不要记混了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430302"
            ]
          },
          "401430302": {
            "id": "401430302",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，还有我帮着记呢！你就放一百个心吧！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430303"
            ]
          },
          "401430303": {
            "id": "401430303",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "一天过去…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430304"
            ]
          },
          "401430304": {
            "id": "401430304",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呃…到几号桌了…一号桌的客人要葱不要辣，二号桌的要辣不要葱…三号桌…三号桌要辣不要辣…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430307"
            ]
          },
          "401430307": {
            "id": "401430307",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "…欸！我、我刚刚是在梦游吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430308"
            ]
          },
          "401430308": {
            "id": "401430308",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你从中途开始就在说胡话了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430309"
            ]
          },
          "401430309": {
            "id": "401430309",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "呜…中间连休息的时间都没有，我的脑子都快变成浆糊了。你们客栈平时有这么多人吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430310"
            ]
          },
          "401430310": {
            "id": "401430310",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "最近还在旺季嘛，你们这是头一次在店里掌勺吧，已经做得很不错了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430311"
            ]
          },
          "401430311": {
            "id": "401430311",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "不过还好这次来的都是熟面孔，也没有提什么偏门的需求，不然怕是会更麻烦。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430312"
            ]
          },
          "401430312": {
            "id": "401430312",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "这些需求还不算偏吗！杏仁豆腐上面居然要淋一勺酱油，连我都没这么吃过！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430313"
            ]
          },
          "401430313": {
            "id": "401430313",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "哈哈，天下那么大，每个人的口味都不一样，能包容一切，才是璃月菜的精髓嘛。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430314"
            ]
          },
          "401430314": {
            "id": "401430314",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "况且这些客人的要求都很明确，只要顺着思路去做就不会跑偏，真正麻烦的，还是那些让你看着办的客人…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430315"
            ]
          },
          "401430315": {
            "id": "401430315",
            "speakerId": 10205,
            "speakerName": "？？？",
            "text": "请问…已经打烊了吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430316"
            ]
          },
          "401430316": {
            "id": "401430316",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "咦？这个声音是…我去看看！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430317"
            ]
          },
          "401430317": {
            "id": "401430317",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "怎么办…好像真的没人…要是我能早点过来…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430318"
            ]
          },
          "401430318": {
            "id": "401430318",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "没事的，现在开始准备野炊，应该也还来得及。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430319"
            ]
          },
          "401430319": {
            "id": "401430319",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "是啊，而且要怪也只能怪哥哥一「采风」就忘了时间…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430320"
            ]
          },
          "401430320": {
            "id": "401430320",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊！林尼、琳妮特、菲米尼，还真是你们！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430321"
            ]
          },
          "401430321": {
            "id": "401430321",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "#派蒙？那…难道{NICKNAME}也…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430322"
            ]
          },
          "401430322": {
            "id": "401430322",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你们好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430323"
            ]
          },
          "401430323": {
            "id": "401430323",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}，派蒙！真没想到会在这里看见你们！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430324"
            ]
          },
          "401430324": {
            "id": "401430324",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "#我刚想说这句话呢，我跟{NICKNAME}是在这里帮忙啦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430325"
            ]
          },
          "401430325": {
            "id": "401430325",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "你们向三人说明了原委…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430326"
            ]
          },
          "401430326": {
            "id": "401430326",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "情况就是这样…倒是你们，怎么会来这里？你们的…呃…「父亲」不会又给你们派了什么任务吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430327"
            ]
          },
          "401430327": {
            "id": "401430327",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "恰恰相反，我们是来璃月度假的，嗯…顺便到处「采风」。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430328"
            ]
          },
          "401430328": {
            "id": "401430328",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "「父亲」说…前阵子我们忙了那么久，也是时候休息一下了，不然不利于下次任务…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430329"
            ]
          },
          "401430329": {
            "id": "401430329",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "机会难得，加上前阵子又是海灯节，哥哥就带着我们来璃月玩了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430330"
            ]
          },
          "401430330": {
            "id": "401430330",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "那林尼说的「采风」是？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430331"
            ]
          },
          "401430331": {
            "id": "401430331",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "我们在璃月港里看到了不少有趣的魔术…哦，在璃月，应该叫它们「戏法」？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430332"
            ]
          },
          "401430332": {
            "id": "401430332",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "还有人把「戏法」跟「璃月戏」、「舞兽戏」结合在一起…真的很精彩。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430333"
            ]
          },
          "401430333": {
            "id": "401430333",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "所以，我们就想在这儿多留几天，看看能不能多收集一些灵感。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430334"
            ]
          },
          "401430334": {
            "id": "401430334",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "之前还去轻策庄拜访了若心婆婆，今天也在附近采风…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430335"
            ]
          },
          "401430335": {
            "id": "401430335",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "结果忘了时间，到现在都没吃上饭。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430336"
            ]
          },
          "401430336": {
            "id": "401430336",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "哈哈…说起吃饭，你也知道，枫丹和璃月都有不少水产，但处理它们的手法各有各的特色。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430337"
            ]
          },
          "401430337": {
            "id": "401430337",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "这回难得过来一趟，不多尝试一下可不行，这也是我们逗留那么久的理由之一吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430338"
            ]
          },
          "401430338": {
            "id": "401430338",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哦哦！那你们都吃了什么？要不要听听我的推荐呀！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430339"
            ]
          },
          "401430339": {
            "id": "401430339",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "…听名字完全不觉得辣的那个鱼。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430340"
            ]
          },
          "401430340": {
            "id": "401430340",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "你说的难道是…「水煮黑背鲈」？头一次听名字是会有这种误解啦…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430341"
            ]
          },
          "401430341": {
            "id": "401430341",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "呵，当时琳妮特看着是鱼、闻着也香，毫无准备地吃了一口，结果被呛得一整天都说不出话。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430342"
            ]
          },
          "401430342": {
            "id": "401430342",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "还好她本来也不喜欢说话…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430343"
            ]
          },
          "401430343": {
            "id": "401430343",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "咕——",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430344"
            ]
          },
          "401430344": {
            "id": "401430344",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "（琳妮特，突然发出了夸张的声音…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430345"
            ]
          },
          "401430345": {
            "id": "401430345",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "哥哥，菲米尼，你们肚子不饿吗。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430346"
            ]
          },
          "401430346": {
            "id": "401430346",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "…是、是有点饿了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430347"
            ]
          },
          "401430347": {
            "id": "401430347",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "#哈…哈哈，说的也是。那{NICKNAME}，就拜托你下厨了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430348"
            ]
          },
          "401430348": {
            "id": "401430348",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "要来点什么呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430349"
            ]
          },
          "401430349": {
            "id": "401430349",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "光看菜单上的名字，也看不出什么…既然凑巧有你在，不如就由你来推荐吧。你也清楚我们的口味，不是么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430350"
            ]
          },
          "401430350": {
            "id": "401430350",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "…那我回后厨商量商量。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430351"
            ]
          },
          "401430351": {
            "id": "401430351",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "还有…请不要放辣，拜托了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014307",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401430401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401430401": {
            "id": "401430401",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "…原来如此，从枫丹来的客人吗，难怪吃不惯重辣。但做得太清淡，又跟他们平时吃的区别不大…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430402"
            ]
          },
          "401430402": {
            "id": "401430402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你有什么推荐的菜吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430403"
            ]
          },
          "401430403": {
            "id": "401430403",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "我想想啊…有一道用蟹粉跟虾仁炒制的菜，虽然看起来浓油重酱，但实际上口味不重，吃着满口都是鲜味！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430404"
            ]
          },
          "401430404": {
            "id": "401430404",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "哦哦，听起来很合适嘛！这道菜的名字叫什么？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430405"
            ]
          },
          "401430405": {
            "id": "401430405",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "嘿，你算是问到点上了，菜谱上说这「蟹黄胜金，虾仁如玉」，所以这道菜的名字，就叫做「金玉满堂」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430406"
            ]
          },
          "401430406": {
            "id": "401430406",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "光看名字还真看不出名堂…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430407"
            ]
          },
          "401430407": {
            "id": "401430407",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "来，这是菜谱，等你做好准备，就上手试试吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014304",
      "subQuestName": "烹制「金玉满堂」",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014305",
      "subQuestName": "为等待已久的枫丹一行人上菜",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401430501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401430501": {
            "id": "401430501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "久等啦！请用——「金玉满堂」！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430502"
            ]
          },
          "401430502": {
            "id": "401430502",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "……",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430503"
            ]
          },
          "401430503": {
            "id": "401430503",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "欸…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430504"
            ]
          },
          "401430504": {
            "id": "401430504",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "#…啊，说起来{NICKNAME}跟派蒙也忙了一天吧，不如一起吃吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430505"
            ]
          },
          "401430505": {
            "id": "401430505",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "被你这么一说，肚子还真有点饿…嘿嘿，那就「恭敬不如从命」了！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430506"
            ]
          },
          "401430506": {
            "id": "401430506",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "不过第一筷还是由客人先动吧。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430507"
            ]
          },
          "401430507": {
            "id": "401430507",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "对、对哦，毕竟这次你们才是客人…嗯？你们怎么都不吃啊？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430508"
            ]
          },
          "401430508": {
            "id": "401430508",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "（酱汁…看起来有点重…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430509"
            ]
          },
          "401430509": {
            "id": "401430509",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "（按璃月的餐桌礼仪…我是不是该先让一让…）",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430510"
            ]
          },
          "401430510": {
            "id": "401430510",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "#…咳，那么，就让我先来尝尝{NICKNAME}的手艺吧！嗯…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430511"
            ]
          },
          "401430511": {
            "id": "401430511",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "怎么样？要喝点水吗？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430512"
            ]
          },
          "401430512": {
            "id": "401430512",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "不用…很鲜，非常纯粹的味道。明明裹了一层酱汁，却只有海洋本身的鲜味…你们也尝尝？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430513"
            ]
          },
          "401430513": {
            "id": "401430513",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "好、好的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430514"
            ]
          },
          "401430514": {
            "id": "401430514",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "这味道…难道是蟹黄？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430515"
            ]
          },
          "401430515": {
            "id": "401430515",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "答对咯！不愧是琳妮特！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430516"
            ]
          },
          "401430516": {
            "id": "401430516",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "难怪能跟虾仁的味道融合得这么好，居然还有这种做法。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430517"
            ]
          },
          "401430517": {
            "id": "401430517",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "嘿嘿，这道菜讲究「虾上加蟹，鲜上加鲜…虾仁之嫩滑，佐以蟹粉之沙糯，鲜香美味，口感绝佳！」",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430518"
            ]
          },
          "401430518": {
            "id": "401430518",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "「更有蟹黄灿烂胜金，虾仁晶莹如玉…」这才有了「金玉满堂」的美名！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430519"
            ]
          },
          "401430519": {
            "id": "401430519",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "这名字原来还有这种说法，确实是挺贴切的。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430520"
            ]
          },
          "401430520": {
            "id": "401430520",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "奇怪…派蒙什么时候这么有学问了？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430523"
            ]
          },
          "401430523": {
            "id": "401430523",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "这道菜应该挺对你胃口吧，琳妮特…嗯？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430524"
            ]
          },
          "401430524": {
            "id": "401430524",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊！「金玉满堂」只剩一半了？什么时候被吃的！",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430525"
            ]
          },
          "401430525": {
            "id": "401430525",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "就在你滔滔不绝的时候…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430526"
            ]
          },
          "401430526": {
            "id": "401430526",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "我听说在璃月，食客对厨师最好的致意，就是多吃一点。非常美味，谢谢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430527"
            ]
          },
          "401430527": {
            "id": "401430527",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "派蒙",
            "text": "啊——你们怎么都开始抢了…喂，给我留点！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014306",
      "subQuestName": "与言笑对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401430601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401430601": {
            "id": "401430601",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "你的朋友还算满意吧？干得不错啊，上手才一天就有这水平。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401430602"
            ]
          },
          "401430602": {
            "id": "401430602",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "#下次也要看你的了，{NICKNAME}。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014393",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401439301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401439301": {
            "id": "401439301",
            "speakerId": 2202,
            "speakerName": "淮安",
            "text": "#哟，{NICKNAME}，今年算是开了个好头呀。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014394",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401439401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401439401": {
            "id": "401439401",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "…琳妮特很少这么直白地表现出自己的喜好，这次居然会先下手为强…难道她也因你改变了吗…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439402"
            ]
          },
          "401439402": {
            "id": "401439402",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "——哈哈，说不定只是因为你做的菜，实在太好吃了呢？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439403"
            ]
          },
          "401439403": {
            "id": "401439403",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "下次如果在枫丹遇上，能请你给其他弟弟妹妹露一手吗，大烹饪师？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439406"
            ]
          },
          "401439406": {
            "id": "401439406",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "哦？那我可得早点开始预约了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014395",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401439501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401439501": {
            "id": "401439501",
            "speakerId": 2204,
            "speakerName": "言笑",
            "text": "「蟹黄胜金，虾仁如玉」…写这菜谱的厨子还真会起名字。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014396",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401439601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401439601": {
            "id": "401439601",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "其实我觉得「水煮黑背鲈」还挺好吃的…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439602"
            ]
          },
          "401439602": {
            "id": "401439602",
            "speakerId": 1071,
            "speakerName": "林尼",
            "text": "只要做好心理准备，就不会被呛着了吧？下次要不要再试试？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439603"
            ]
          },
          "401439603": {
            "id": "401439603",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "…不必了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014397",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401439701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401439701": {
            "id": "401439701",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "筷子…终于能正常用上了。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439702"
            ]
          },
          "401439702": {
            "id": "401439702",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你在练习吗，菲米尼？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439703"
            ]
          },
          "401439703": {
            "id": "401439703",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "嗯，林尼和琳妮特的手都很巧，几乎一来璃月就适应了，不像我，最近才开始熟练…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439704"
            ]
          },
          "401439704": {
            "id": "401439704",
            "speakerId": 1074,
            "speakerName": "菲米尼",
            "text": "说起来璃月还有用碗筷表演的「戏法」…想做好魔术助理，这些练习也不能落下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4014398",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "401439801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "401439801": {
            "id": "401439801",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "能量补充过多…进入消化模式。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439802"
            ]
          },
          "401439802": {
            "id": "401439802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "难得见到你胃口这么好呢。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439803"
            ]
          },
          "401439803": {
            "id": "401439803",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "嗯…虽然平时为了保持身形，我跟哥哥都不会吃太多。出于礼仪考虑，在餐桌上也会节制些。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439804"
            ]
          },
          "401439804": {
            "id": "401439804",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "不过偶尔在家人面前任性一点，也没什么不好。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "401439805"
            ]
          },
          "401439805": {
            "id": "401439805",
            "speakerId": 1072,
            "speakerName": "琳妮特",
            "text": "…如果真的等哥哥跟菲米尼互相谦让完，估计菜已经凉了。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}